sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App
    participant S as Shadow service
    participant D as Device
    Note over D: Device offline
    A->>S: UPDATE desired.power=on
    S-->>A: Accepted
    D->>S: Reconnect and subscribe to exact response and delta topics
    S-->>D: Subscription ready
    D->>S: GET current Shadow
    S-->>D: Current state and version
    D->>D: Reconcile desired with actual hardware
    D->>S: UPDATE reported with actual state
    S-->>D: Accepted
    Note over D: Deduplicate notifications and ignore older versions
